  "faq": [
    {
      "question": "What is Juhu known for?",
      "answer": "Juhu is known for Juhu Beach (one of Mumbai's most famous beaches), its celebrity bungalows along Juhu Tara Road and Gulmohar Road, the iconic ISKCON temple, premium five-star hotels and being one of Mumbai's most upscale and glamorous residential neighbourhoods."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the pin code of Juhu?",
      "answer": "Juhu primarily uses pin code 400049, with the JVPD Scheme and parts of the Vile Parle border belt also covered under 400049 and 400056."
    },
    {
      "question": "What are the sub-areas within Juhu?",
      "answer": "The main micro-localities within Juhu are Juhu Beach, Juhu Tara Road, Gulmohar Road, JVPD Scheme (Juhu Vile Parle Development), Juhu Koliwada, Juhu Galli and the Vile Parle border belt."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the property price in Juhu?",
      "answer": "Property prices in Juhu are among Mumbai's highest, ranging from around ₹2.5–4 Cr for a 2BHK in the JVPD Scheme to ₹6–15 Cr+ for premium and sea-facing flats along Juhu Tara Road and Gulmohar Road. Rental rates range from ₹60,000 to ₹3 lakh+ per month depending on the sub-area and flat size (as of May 2026)."
    },
    {
      "question": "How to commute from Juhu?",
      "answer": "Juhu is served by the nearby Vile Parle and Andheri railway stations on the Western Line, the Western Express Highway, Juhu Tara Road and SV Road, BEST buses, and is close to Metro Line 1 and the upcoming Versova–Bandra Sea Link. The airport is about 15–20 minutes away."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which hospitals are in Juhu?",
      "answer": "Major hospitals in and near Juhu include Nanavati Max Super Speciality Hospital, Cooper Hospital (HBT Medical College), Sujay Hospital and several premium clinics and nursing homes across the JVPD Scheme and Juhu Tara Road belt."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which schools are in Juhu?",
      "answer": "Notable schools in Juhu include Jamnabai Narsee School, Utpal Sanghvi School, Maneckji Cooper Education Trust School and the Narsee Monjee colleges in the adjoining JVPD Scheme."
    },
    {
      "question": "How do I find the best dentists in Juhu?",
      "answer": "Browse Mumbai96's Juhu listings, read reviews from locals and call directly. Our verified directory makes it easy."
    }
